<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>GrandRP 2560 x 1440 WQHD</Major>
    <Description>With this macro you can empty your market either on GrandRP without any effort. The macro only needs 20 seconds to empty all 30 slots.

If you only want to empty rows 1, 2 and 5 for example, you can insert a “Go to” before the start of row 3 and skip to line 46, effectively skipping rows 3 and 4.

Depending on whether your system is strong and therefore has a fast response time or not, you can select all lines in the macro accordingly and change the time delays to meet your requirements.

The only working resolution: 2560 x 1440 WQHD


If you need help or have any suggestions on which macro I should create next, please let me know.


If you need help or have any suggestions on which macro I should create next, please let me know.

</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>//1st row
MoveTo 1160 335
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1450 160
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1577 -160
GoWhile 3 6
//2nd row
MoveTo 1161 433
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1450 160
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1577 -160
GoWhile 14 6
//3rd row
MoveTo 1161 527
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1450 160
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1577 -160
GoWhile 25 6
//4th row
MoveTo 1155 610
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1450 160
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1577 -160
GoWhile 36 6
//5th row
MoveTo 1159 714
Delay 164 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR -1450 160
Delay 164 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 164 ms
MoveR 1577 -160
GoWhile 47 6</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
